{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/79770de1041c283b8e78a79d2aa093ba411739a498bdef035ef66575b98fe95b38da67439ec10e58c4bfc940c3c164bbc2ce5e5a30b47faba097919bd6a5f7df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6dd246f0e17478a95a45a732e74708b4f32af55cafea08952faf3c9f94b5a363afbcff9f71e67a8b344c26c6ab01ee35dc0f046408f2e0cb59ed2d8e34535d75965895b3f26e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8f8e056658e285fd2cd77099cb259818f6bd94106f07dca3f775faa0b7d844deed6513fe67561dd30825a93d2a88a32a2bb87dcd16b22cd75bb764f1867a04e371a0fba3d4628f0c3c2957e6c7331cd3e602ee075e7038d58c253e27b40b81b3a68e7a3894bc7cb0859031b26716c7e6586292ff1ff4da91\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2be9a60c470393ef1f3cc003fc0019916dcafa04d80add6186b1afda2f20df260c4711a703fe0b108b5f31cca77be4c6e573cc50f379b23c66c946fd1bb55e45b64738924e9dcef19ac1f056e6128647416b6d6bc66d99303fec2ab4eea15fd142b989b4c7271cd0e63abc5dd5c971a52b88c6a1dde63da0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fd250603433bc7a9ab5341726901822f133974c9b791f6ef2770e88dc3080e0e7253d97667d7b4c3d315ff2978b3f29e7dca2767358c974c883520d928602d83057cbda601645f7fe4f524487912c6bec36e0f77984bc1ba59b90c044fa9a8a7efc3ed2fa1b08140313fca19e71ba98782192c0c62bc885a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6a702c94f85464ba956568ab809136530cd75aed6c6847ec55fd76cf74c2f2cb76bb2a7a4e333551bc89d8b5436adf967523892561bed034c3f7f25224fd59308448f9b3cf0bb8f48a2f9968453956519f4957fbcb4daa2343e7da90c909abcde72d9dea80716b94accc3a0f68d1040ab5162e4899430f1f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2fa3467911e0e2388edc238ad3660c0783794e3972f42471794a2c6011a837d4821a3a584d1cfb4d37a37d9f662f8637e2c8427135758c8d14a79898e8033e593ffc57bbcfada48bf1dec997f70570e51e40c1aa6f3f2876b63a797959e82664aee3f60bcfad30e3bea0d1b5a4dfd5668acdb93fae5edd26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6b02b8cb54280d771edd51ae6c5c6f07da55690d4afb65208931e86b12d9579df8db4b62cad01b6588d559d51e6519ec640f26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/af161db93407c982f51d1177944adba356902ee323b0cb97b9eba7cff237e30f407e4a9c7caa5e0c106ab3d457bb17196f2d9df427c6f701f3b5f99c5749c21fd7c2b31ca179965ed771e053822d1e3c6344d81dc22dcd2282e669b7b8cb88c2ad2a5c9664c71fa9a414c581d71bb682f697d39056d61318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/be8df569df80bc9f3606c8b461a1ec122ade3f44ff0b5c8d3116e527b9473a22905d24d8647e1b1f05608dea9e2edefc8924c861388c05444f1c36a980a6c5c5f79f70383519ed846f957cb0e37ae2209ea04fd34069e70c2826ac963cec4f8d9ff2c5d2693d61899801f6e00cc651a37ae25fa067f236e2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/313129040af07acc0dfc08057b608222d3539100f46410555e3c3c8806ca5ac2805a96512477adbb2ead104d2443f65ed18a9ab839d78540c7bce560c71d35ee00a31bad1a84fca577aa0b3195bfd210eff64156750df2567584715add5a415f8cc5fe5153494ea8337d0d011a4dfde58c7b4910e1d02b98\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e7a9535154eb423d0d31c7effcea8c96f3725ce692ca54a23e48a77de43e0ebf69d3ee744562b2badd7db8070c2d43af2c2ef5ed189dd88cc08d748581e6d63e49a5d08a6e95d8ed4bb5e5da513590175c012f777c8b3e5a7bfa5c2dcbb335c192e1747640daabaf7147d4079fde90d83511b2c48b87c9fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93ace35a2a3eabddb8e2c23e68bf9f9e1599f31f8f15245ce5500136aeb3e263c4968023a297cfc69b3999acbca55944e8f51c8da07932dfe82a8da70d11dc209e6044e7b156148cd695eb9d13710767ac4d9a9f97c96d40dd64076c998351681700612103c64a69da3b3d09b915b42821ef38c993bfb476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6feeeab995f25727a2164820f363acf32bee0b1ab98f89600ab63d62844a7e091247fabf6cc4ebcfcab2d641fa395b102eff54274eaefb576754900df2956613cf082cfc434c7b8d3b85553bab142b73b441a802f7d61c28ed1c9eac4765b65031758aea34ada22da79815e797063379befb0f97c57e414d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/00d413089fd16f2dadf4c32eba466822303f8113ed854ae90a725ccce7781616a3bf948d7a595223545aa6b042b3e55970bc19ca851c10a98332104044b07a1b826abcee6f52438b2f14a214578ec5ff0b3faecb9a011daa2d8a96fe5e98bfff4832681015d13f2f916e86653340ad7de0efe2f1097af705\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93309989ef7c9dac562de7835bc6815097e1b90762eca4cc2b8fb23899322f0cc2f3b93a13a0027dbc15b80bdce5cc0f38396751043e4b396e453e1a1775dbc2473449e1be04a4c2deaba20e2916a15dd336ff600d47f6b75ced8f6bc3dd9356b5ced6820f3616e69a07d3ca1869fd5b1f80732fad784059\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/de0925a80e83641df301e6f156d01377effdb377897510ba34b5adf68c266652924d119e169563ff2899d9b3cdcc5a161468badfcac76cff0cc9977c78e1d5d51317b6515fcc826d78c09fc9c6495092cb729f09917ca92b935c8c839700fcc7ea59bb87f31e3ae0ba8aca293093e3c1624465bec6032818\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6ec6222f8b76458a7eb57c16a256230dd3f5b775b1e8999ba1879837871e0e8f8f9800e00712b7c96365bf6b712201e83d37b39ece61a8c4bc713526c671728f8df2a1c806d1eb9b00e4439f963587fcee89fa8ed2cf16d956b14f039cc16f9cabe93cbbeaa7edbbcd402ebc5dcf85ec33b9a3e880a21001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e3d05ff1c77d2f4f98d9dccaa8e860cf08ac0c9f02453ef83b34c7ff4fbcd719a8a3c7b1c5a9c413952dc79f9e7edba88c54d8f1660c3e3e41fdb986dcf8c90c37ee40d7a600aeb8442b2b2f9606e3676c3976f7570e3381baf0a26d07d831637c9061989056faf8ec7f661134bedb7bd0d6b9c7bc686f76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a195ba02c0ea378fe4a1db0641eaf902e3b7be94fd17ec0fa2ee6dd836a31f5b103d02a7632e570477c85cec3080c276c5109f05bd9993fb8e8c9e088137a1da20ba10bcd8875e8010b6c6c25a5be6fe46efd4acd0cf7edbd3aebf5d2193bafe068adcf3b7a5318fcdfce6ac348f6d606c533d78760f6682\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e50efc59fdd065bb9c308a530f7816b2d0f937b57ecad94701f338d5a600ad56351c30f36c8c2462c8954fcc233f160bf4291a30c21daac7465d519e0c219a95c01fcb0af9f18b77f396f2545369b3cc07acde9d3966a3e8a4b434e8a41b42bc9f8d5dd3e9e84707caf3f76cca085ad1556bca9bcadddb81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/01c28aa13a8ad3d3ed890c72036ba202f99ff7b75cb6a62c04e95819be14cf4dd65eba9bc91356ba9d935f5a295d6b980bd042eae7b559b3cffe6130c7ddc40b1bbe3c17c84a5da1b4188949a1e5e72925198a01247e087aacd56f519da599190561beb3d10ee56e7c701d9cebf72f863c165d3e789fdec7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7838a5984052c1ad07dc4dcd11eecd32739b6aadd3393dddb8399d4ae5ec14d550a610c2032d354fad73c1684fce7749349ff115c676caa615c0628677d0e0abe48a1ca16ee5e9d974a866a362d0bb37f7a34eb709e9f0ade20b96891436b48420e420e30f01c4e46f25e3e3beeafb511a509a55dd30b4aa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/601fc6bc73e9c78d777ba55586c828cd58507e9fc29e00b9b95f7e6b0d3fd4ce74399bf536ae8159654d912e98e8caadbcae3bb81786308efff286e4d319fa36494cf25ffc0772bd8ba1ce1d6f9aca01351e3d69ee62308a7d923769c249906d10d1dccc318256ddd0ada16bfcccc83b4f2b9ef0ad8426f2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4d18c4ea2d4c3c4545a625767fc5e29f3228be7cc3380cbc35dc3240a5abb067f01b8a8f0aba70b1e0c242348d5445b873aa6d38d8d64fe858c4e1ee1bc086561dc09bd28f49c1062ee6623c76b870ad123812b74453dc6673522f4bdc56a1fd087daf1415fde55c25b0c10b8a092e911c34e1ec40c5418f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c5f9cdb94e00287b05e1cdb1379b7d624c450f87de9e9962abc989036744d01c42a3636662786a05f3679a5a3e945f0ba5e623fb4afc3bfaf9feeb3ade382f3432a0342442b10fc668d891054397108501d7a8299fbd5ca44d752ce93921e55ce4a14b4d08b8b0e396be97ac983f7c55517df65367bc0fc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dc708f76fccf0b08c914b105c4e8e7b83e26a9376e12dba6f51398ab21deb0eaba35975089aa6333bca75cd5505eac295db5dfcc56cd31f22a38376799c41938c2402472b5b24a654e2dfa81698205643b0a17339503ce6538711787e3cec73e569fb051639f792c5753c25bdc32662a58ed16a1ffa5d3cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/91399a75fb778ce8714a09294768494be167832c0f1a88b994d1ae84003bd6b4d34056bc06a65c174e45b1aae86b992361ed359025f12c4ec1c475d67cc11ff1ccc4ac1434e2629031f31335dc33ba2abfea009ce9725651072bf2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ccd6761b1eae000f7ad51bceadb9c343a4b04d422728e52a623798aa1449c5f9d967c5b8f5e4a24e619ff33c38c5ca62513a12d186f3e748b804f505b61f9671a2b06f050102ea5390e163e23e581628d114e179ec4b57fd3e736f5edfe34ccb60346a4732d77927957a387dfce09b3c47bcedc7bcd8413a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c29a8cf456d08fd36fd4fedb54000595b467232e5c910a10811bdee59e49da03d9fced8027e93f3206fa7d235d2535044b310168d3b3e083690f248943bfb2526bfafcc109c02a46b76cb2bf2707837ccfeae73513f368b769a96cceb08c594ee93cf04aa1e5526b5e1de9f630ec75278b2c4b04f2115b0f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d34d331c59b9a318dbd9c17ab007c6058e25f56df7970614ea312f92a575eb9e841c23ba390e72361ebcb03ea1375e6e0f0df1138539e978755b9808baff8ce19cd8e1368176ced98696a061210a386b39e93902b7be6acb011bcd4e7d175459ad0120765ff914159b3daff5b746235ce211ab2ae995af68\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9bd8de6de689108c9faec733f182d5e7976e5468407efca04248a3a09aa2938b7728d0884494980081115aac8768644af4d159be64f4f93167671cb3f151297b739460fc5613c1da8229cba95a9e8ac8d73a8f65ee620ee5dd097f22e0535f879e4b901d27f5a354607d3c1be4f04e06a2b63f0e35887f15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6d77fe2bafe8ee1a6f1c80898e5c15601660355c2c26be0595632329d68185c2fea271fdd03f8ad58a8162790c730c479a56beac41fe5447555c7e676961d74913b13f05078f95d1aff42412ba336c2f5306d60a056364225b386ef31045e4e456d081485dc50c4aa817c0db40ddd49fc5d43f3fc7ff99c6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c6590ffaf3eb29d93fcced2bff273ba2696cb545a84b5894866092d873c6c86cd32024d5922ad0be91d56d31feb7e8ce85745f81dea5ec9691cc351c0bee95cbdea14c54d3430a76d310b18aa0eea6afd35d590477193dfad5c91ea0b0cd7bcc3da69796255e553db0cb42990012933980f4e7a47c8ccf80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/04eb113229a759d20bad16d4e8f95b83e488bdb494d7f7544fece3ffb9861dd14cd5957fb2f476065d7f6dc4f628db12245b1a95d3d0d4bff069b48fa264495d8bf1046563cf80a8959e5af33dcba633729de8bb4d365b6da0709d63992edda610aa746894352b420935c409da6dc46dcc60c2528a4305d0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
